# Optional — the site works fully WITHOUT any of these.
# A future assistant provider would plug in here behind /api/ask.
# Nothing is read at runtime today; this file documents intent only.

# PROVIDER=none
# PROVIDER_API_KEY=

# Global orbit leaderboard (Upstash Redis REST, free tier, no card).
# Create a free database at upstash.com → Redis → copy REST URL + READ_WRITE token.
# Until these are set, the game runs on local-best only and the 👑 chip hides.
# NOTE: these two are fetched from the BROWSER (game submits scores
# directly to Upstash REST). They are public by design — no admin/secret
# token may ever use the NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix. Abuse is bounded client-side
# (score cap 50000, top-50 trim, random member ids, no PII), but anyone
# with the URL can write junk rows: check the dashboard if scores look odd.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_UPSTASH_URL=https://xxx.upstash.io
# NEXT_PUBLIC_UPSTASH_TOKEN=AXxx...

# Canonical production URL is fixed in src/app/layout.tsx
# (https://deepnar-workstation.vercel.app) — no env var needed for metadata.
